.el .ds Aq '
.TH tensor-wasm-snapshot 1  "tensor-wasm-snapshot " 
.SH NAME
tensor\-wasm\-snapshot \- Save or restore an instance snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtensor\-wasm\-snapshot\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save or restore an instance snapshot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-snapshot\-save(1)
Capture the state of a running instance into a `.tensor\-wasm` file via the API
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-snapshot\-restore(1)
Restore an instance from a `.tensor\-wasm` archive via the API
.TP
tensor\-wasm\-snapshot\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
